WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.075 --> 00:00:01.950
JAMES ANDERSON: Hi, I'm
Jim Anderson, and I'm

00:00:01.950 --> 00:00:04.680
a professor of Chemistry
at Harvard University.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:08.520
Physical Sciences 11x
provides a powerful foundation

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:12.840
not only in the core topics of
thermodynamics, acid base reactions,

00:00:12.840 --> 00:00:16.530
electrochemistry, quantum mechanics,
chemical reactivity, kinetics,

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:20.490
and nuclear chemistry, but
also an explicit treatment

00:00:20.490 --> 00:00:25.620
of how these core concepts link directly
into the global context of rapidly

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:29.160
developing frontiers in
innovative technology.

00:00:29.160 --> 00:00:31.580
Join us in this endeavor.

